abstract: >-
  An open book of executed Jupyter notebooks, with a small Python package, on
  heat and mass transfer: conduction, convection, heat exchangers, radiation,
  diffusion and simultaneous heat and mass transfer, taught through engineering
  problems. Every result is checked against an exact or independent numerical
  solution, and properties come from formulas fitted to the international
  reference equations.
